\[\sigma^{2}=\frac{1}{n}1n\Bigg{(}\frac{M_{2}}{M_{1}^{2}}\Bigg{)}\] \[M_{1}=\sum_{i=1}^{n}x_{i}F_{i}\] \[M_{2}=\sum_{i=1}^{n}\sum_{j=1}^{n}w_{i}w_{j}F_{i}F_{j}e^{\rho_{ ij}\sigma_{i}\sigma_{j}T}\] \[F=M_{1}\]

