\[=N\cdot a+\frac{N}{S_{0}}\cdot max(0;(1-a)\cdot S_{0}+b\cdot(S_{T}-S_{0}))=\]

\[=N\cdot a+\frac{N\cdot b}{S_{0}}max\bigg{(}0;S_{T}-S_{0}\bigg{(}1-\frac{1-a}{ b}\bigg{)}\bigg{)}\]

where

\(R\): redemption amount

